SUMMARY:June Meetup - World-Class Speaker\, networking and swag
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nWe're back for our June meetup on 
 Wednesday evening\, June 24!\n\n**The world-class speaker will be announce
 d soon** \\- be on the lookout\\\, but save the date now and plan to atten
 d\\.\nDoors will open at 6:00 pm\, live programming will begin at 6:30 pm 
 sharp. We'll wrap up no later than 8:00 pm as we know it's work night for 
 everyone.\n\n**Location:**\nCisco's RTP campus\nBuilding 10\n7200-10 Kit C
 reek Road\nMorrisville\, NC\n\n**FREE attendance**\nAttendance is FREE\, a
 s always.\n\n**Free Swag and food and beverages**\nSwag (shirts\, hats\, s
 tickers) and food and beverages will be served onsite\, but quantities wil
 l be limited\, so arrive early if interested.\n\n**Questions?** Contact us
  at info@allthingsopen.org.\n\n**RSVP require**\n\\*This is a free event. 
 However\, an RSVP is required. Seating is limited\, so RSVP's will be capp
 ed as we fill up. Please move quickly and RSVP to save your spot if intere
 sted. When you RSVP you will be added to our mailing list to receive futur
 e event updates. You can unsubscribe at any time.
